[{"title":"僧房秋夜","author":"王恭","text":"古木閒岩坐入禅，碧萝飞处一灯悬。\n萧萧天籁千峰月，梦落秋潭午夜泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35042,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人吹箫","author":"王恭","text":"石栏干畔绿蕉阴，紫竹閒吹学凤吟。\n寂寂长门春掩静，商声那得到君心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人度分水关","author":"王恭","text":"铁锁重关路渺漫，岭头分水夜声寒。\n君今欲度归何日，应使行人羡郭丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羌儿吹笛","author":"王恭","text":"雪净阴山片月微，数声羌笛起依稀。\n不堪吹作梅花调，多少边人尚未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏秋风","author":"王恭","text":"朝来拂拂洒征衣，吹得关河叶渐稀。\n回首茂陵何处在，空馀汾水白云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观猎","author":"王恭","text":"九月淮天百草枯，晓分千骑猎平芜。\n弯弓射杀南山豹，归醉吴姬卖酒垆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书王孙射雁图","author":"王恭","text":"锦袍朱帽绿弓弦，却射飞鸿灞水边。\n不识柳林关外路，白狼黄鼠满秋田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽方山上人","author":"王恭","text":"新塔荒山生野烟，飘然只履向何天。\n禅家自是无生灭，尘世空馀有泪悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈乌","author":"王恭","text":"朝天寒陇莫霜林，来往长悬反哺心。\n借女庭前双栗树，空山不用结巢深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园晓步","author":"王恭","text":"凉风飞露冷飘飘，菱叶茨菰色渐凋。\n莫叹林塘秋气早，五陵烟树亦萧条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈安素题洞玄子所寄墨梅","author":"王恭","text":"江郭遥闻鹤上笙，也将仙墨寄多情。\n相思几度閒花落，厌听孤城一笛声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王羲之爱鹅图","author":"王恭","text":"双翎閒汎墨池冰，悟入霜毫思不胜。\n遂使萧郎穷墨妙，兰亭应是掩昭陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵太祖蹴毬图","author":"王恭","text":"天上欢娱蹴画毬，太平应得侍宸游。\n龙姿已是黄袍贵，何事军中乐未休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"信鸟","author":"王恭","text":"双鸟枝头弄早春，若为飞去报音尘。\n青绫月冷空庭曙，正对残灯忆远人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹梅双雀","author":"王恭","text":"倦飞双雀也知寒，梅竹霜空羽异残。\n回首梁园千树晚，栖迟聊寄一枝安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书朱氏家藏墨竹","author":"王恭","text":"丛色脩脩覆石根，春风曾见长儿孙。\n清时好制虞庭乐，何事青青老故园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书朱氏家藏画鹰","author":"王恭","text":"一别长杨脱锦绦，秋风閒立气偏豪。\n纷纷野雀休惊啅，自向山林惜羽毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孤竹","author":"王恭","text":"直节何辞老石根，几回风雨共苔痕。\n自从悟得孤生意，行到梁园却厌繁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高景度画沧洲景寄舅氏陈拙脩","author":"王恭","text":"绿杨风引白鸥波，波上遥峰扫黛蛾。\n莫道同心如白水，渭阳回首更情多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甬东诸葛宗道所作山水小景陈师贡索题其上","author":"王恭","text":"蓬莱宫树晚茸茸，却望青青远寄踪。\n应想旧时猿鹤伴，独携归兴度深松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈召外馆山水图","author":"王恭","text":"云木深深少四邻，绿萝青壁断行人。\n扁舟已是桃花水，更问仙源隔几尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书四爱图 其一","author":"王恭","text":"内史风流逸思多，黄庭读罢兴如何。\n道林祗解怜鹰鸟，未胜临池独爱鹅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书四爱图 其二","author":"王恭","text":"放鹤亭边月影凉，六桥行处见微霜。\n瘦筇不过钱塘水，只对梅花嗅冷香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书四爱图 其三","author":"王恭","text":"种藕池边秋草深，朱华曾此遇知音。\n只今惟有濂溪水，照见千秋万古心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书四爱图 其四","author":"王恭","text":"南宋诸陵草树秋，尚怜太史旧风流。\n如今九畹青青色，正在湘潭雨里愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨菊 其二","author":"王恭","text":"湘江閒唱九歌声，栗里应辞五斗荣。\n谁谓秋来风物冷，露黄烟翠不关情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题木芙蓉","author":"王恭","text":"西风吹袖玉颜酡，摇落襟期奈尔何。\n一自雁池清赏后，梁王宾客已无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书画马四图 其一","author":"王恭","text":"桃花满背汗沾毛，太仆承恩意自豪。\n休道盐车稀骏骨，逢人谁是九方皋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书画马四图 其二","author":"王恭","text":"玉河冰水浴青云，啮膝骄行迥不群。\n神骏祗今图画里，灞陵谁貌旧将军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书画马四图 其三","author":"王恭","text":"监牧年深得马情，如今犹系茜红缨。\n官中几日无游幸，閒向龙池缓缓行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书画马四图 其四","author":"王恭","text":"背上青毛玉作团，圉人欲控更回看。\n春风几度长楸草，不见交河雪满鞍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白莲图为番昜郭巡警赋","author":"王恭","text":"素袜凌波绿锦裳，参差玉佩夜微凉。\n清芬已在瑶池上，况是新承雨露香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书方壶清响生琳琅","author":"王恭","text":"鹤上瑶笙去不还，却留仙墨在人间。\n秋风更洒筼筜玉，犹似凌云响佩环。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书萧子厚牧牛图","author":"王恭","text":"閒吹芦叶应村讴，贪弄山禽忘却牛。\n原草青青陂水绿，莫令文绣感庄周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柯敬仲古木竹石图","author":"王恭","text":"龙虎飞腾凤影孤，水苍鸣佩小珊瑚。\n汉家陵树秋萧索，也似秋声落画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题苏明远墨菊","author":"王恭","text":"九月傲霜秋草衰，黄花偏解与秋期。\n玉堂天上同声远，满目寒香欲待谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈石田题雪窗悬崖双清图","author":"王恭","text":"丛竹香深蕙草寒，孤高遥在翠微间。\n上林何限看春客，未借金梯此再扳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨竹","author":"王恭","text":"篬筤枝上雨冥冥，不似黄陵倚棹听。\n忆得小堂清响夜，银灯犹在酒初醒。","collection":"明","noti